SPOILER ALERT!


The easiest way I have found (and it works even if I have to drop stuff
and get my collection of amulets mixed up) is to name them.  Names don't
seem to stick to the real amulet very well...  But the fake ones keep
their names right nicely!

It is sometimes useful to have a fake amulet around.  If the wiz steals
the amulet, he'll take the first one in your inventory.  (Plastic or not)
If he gets the plastic one, let him have it!

